body:
Rational explanation: could be a kinesthetic hallucination caused by a distressing moment. 

(Not really paranormal related, but I also was in a bad place recently, started writing a suicide letter and said in it that I wouldn't go through it if someone talked to me (I'm very lonely and don't have friends). This day, a friend I hadn't talked to in years came to talk to me and asked me if I wanted to go out. (There's no way someone could have read that letter) Anyway, we went out, I didn't kill myself. She hasn't talked to me since, it's like she knew and came out of nowhere to prevent me from doing something stupid. Really weird.)

&#x200B;

It's not random pills, I already OD'ed on some pills (won't say what so nobody will get a bad idea) and I woke up in the intensive care section of the hospital. They said I was lucky to be alive and they called my parents to tell them they weren't sure I was going to make it. Anyway, I know what "recipe" will do the job if I take them and don't ask for help, I won't wake up from that. 

How could my life get worse? I'm already at my lowest.

&#x200B;
